From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devcore94 <devcore94@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:28:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] camera: mark PPP drafts as DRM

SecMediaProvider requires post-processing draft rows to set is_drm=1 so
unfinished images cannot be uploaded to cloud providers. Camera marked the
rows with _data_draft and the PPP SEF type but omitted the DRM flag, causing
every draft insert to fail and the post-processor to enter recovery.

Set the required value only for PPP draft rows. Final media rows keep their
normal metadata when the post-processing sequence completes.
---
 .../processor/database/PostProcessDBHelper.smali   | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/processor/database/PostProcessDBHelper.smali b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/processor/database/PostProcessDBHelper.smali
--- a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/processor/database/PostProcessDBHelper.smali
+++ b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/processor/database/PostProcessDBHelper.smali
@@ -2535,6 +2535,16 @@
 
     invoke-virtual {p0, p2, p1}, Landroid/content/ContentValues;->put(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/Integer;)V
 
+    const/4 p1, 0x1
+
+    invoke-static {p1}, Ljava/lang/Integer;->valueOf(I)Ljava/lang/Integer;
+
+    move-result-object p1
+
+    const-string p2, "is_drm"
+
+    invoke-virtual {p0, p2, p1}, Landroid/content/ContentValues;->put(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/Integer;)V
+
     :cond_0
     return-void
 .end method
